  "historyNote": "#2233, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2949, eff 1-7-85, EXPIRED 1-7-91 New. #5251, eff 10-21-91 (formerly Saf-M 1103.02); ss by #6604, INTERIM, eff 10-18-97, EXPIRED 2-15-98; ss by #6663, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06 New. #8569, INTERIM, eff 2-18-06, EXPIRED: 8-17-06 New. #8966, eff 8-23-07; ss by #11028, eff 1-29-16",
